{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/extras/Steam_Frame_1.jpg?t=1742311702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/extras/Steam_Frame_3.jpg?t=1742311702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/extras/Steam_Frame_7.jpg?t=1742311702\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/extras/Steam_Frame_5.jpg?t=1742311702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast-paced Action RPG meets rogue-lite mechanics for an explosive mix. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attack and Support!  Switch between the two skillsets and find creative ways to use these in tactical battles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resurrect and reanimate your legions and customise their capabilities as you see fit. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock spells, abilities and new minions to fight alongside you. Try them. Every run will feel different.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/extras/Wishlist_Now_609x130.gif?t=1742311702\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1839820?t=1742311702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742311702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742311702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742311